<Legal updated="October 2026" title="Privacy Policy" description="How Krylabs collects, uses and protects your information across its websites, apps and products.">

  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Krylabs ({site.legalName}, a sole proprietorship owned and
  operated by {site.founder.legalName}, {addressLine})
  collects, uses and protects information when you use our websites, apps and digital products.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>Depending on the product, we may collect information you provide directly (such as your name, email or phone number), and limited technical information (such as device type and app diagnostics) needed to operate and improve the service.</p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>We use information to provide and maintain our products, respond to support requests, improve features, and keep our services secure. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>Payments for purchases made directly through our websites and apps are processed by
  RBI-authorised third-party payment aggregators, such as <strong>Razorpay</strong>. Your payment
  details (card number, UPI ID, bank details) are collected and processed by the payment aggregator
  on their PCI DSS&ndash;compliant systems and are governed by their privacy policy &mdash; we do not
  see or store your card or banking credentials. We receive only the transaction confirmation and
  limited details (such as transaction ID and amount) needed for order fulfilment, support and refunds.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our website does not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. We use only essential
  cookies and local storage where needed to keep you signed in or remember your preferences.
  Third-party payment pages may set their own cookies as described in their respective policies.</p>

  <h2>Website visits</h2>
  <p>This website runs no analytics service and no third-party tracking script. Like most web
  servers, ours keeps an access log of each request: the page, the time, the IP address and the
  browser's user agent. When you press a contact or app store link, the site makes one more
  request that says which link was pressed, and it is logged the same way. No cookie is set and
  no identifier is created. We read these logs in aggregate to see which
  pages are visited and to keep the site secure. They are not combined with any other data about
  you and are not shared.</p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to provide our services and meet legal obligations. Some products store data only on your own device.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.</p>

  <h2>Grievance Officer</h2>
  <p>
    In accordance with applicable Indian law, the Grievance Officer for Krylabs is:<br />
    <strong>{site.founder.legalName}</strong>, Proprietor<br />
    {addressLine}<br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:info.krylabs@gmail.com">info.krylabs@gmail.com</a><br />
    Phone: <a href="tel:+918597165755">+91-8597165755</a><br />
    Grievances are acknowledged within 24 hours and resolved within 15 days.
  </p>
</Legal>
